	Usage:
	  unikraft instances stop <name> ... [flags]

	Stop one or more instances.

	Arguments:
	  <name> ...
	          Names of the instances to stop.

	Examples:
	  # Stop an instance
	  unikraft instance stop demo-instance

	  # Stop with a drain timeout
